{"id":14694,"author":"Swerfie","body":"Hi my username is swerfie\u003cbr\u003ethe reason i was banned was because i was using anti knock-back mods/hacks\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003ei have been playing avicus network since 2012 i have shared it with my friends and played with a lot of nice people on this server and I've been banned for 3 months now i hope that i can rejoin your server and play \u0026nbsp;the amazing games you have. there are no other servers as good as this i like this server\u0026nbsp;because\u0026nbsp;it has a great community, respectful moderators and great pvp based games i have went from server to\u0026nbsp;server trying to find\u0026nbsp;game mode\u0026nbsp;like these but i have found none. I have\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ethank you\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e-Swerfie","body_tagged":"Hi my username is swerfie\u003cbr\u003ethe reason i was banned was because i was using anti knock-back mods/hacks\u003cbr\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"line-height: 24px;\"\u003ei have been playing avicus network since 2012 i have shared it with my friends and played with a lot of nice people on this server and I've been banned for 3 months now i hope that i can rejoin your server and play \u0026nbsp;the amazing games you have. there are no other servers as good as this i like this server\u0026nbsp;because\u0026nbsp;it has a great community, respectful moderators and great pvp based games i have went from server to\u0026nbsp;server trying to find\u0026nbsp;game mode\u0026nbsp;like these but i have found none. I have\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ethank you\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e-Swerfie","created_at":1435797071,"title":"swerfie's appeal","replies":[{"id":203987,"author":"Colecrc","body":"\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eHello,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eDue to the lack of video evidence,and the fact you have waited long enough. I have decided to appeal the ban.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eIf you're caught hacking again you'll have close to 0% chance of getting appealed again.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eRegards,\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.39